                <head>378. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On August 30 the National Security Council at its 295th meeting discussed the
                    question of United States policy in Southeast Asia with particular reference to
                        NSC 5612, August 15, “U.S. Policy in
                    Mainland Southeast Asia”. Laos was among the topics in the NSC paper and among the topics discussed at the
                        NSC meeting. Both the memorandum of
                    discussion at the NSC meeting and NSC 5612/1, September 5, are printed as <ref
                        target="#d118">Documents 118</ref> and <ref target="#d119">119</ref>.</p>
            </div>
